1             wealth + anc_visits + residence + tribal      4485   3312.041
2 wealth + education + anc_visits + residence + tribal      4476   3275.179
    Test    Df LR stat.      Pr(Chi)
1                                   
2 1 vs 2     9 36.86209 2.785207e-05
```


