cmVkaWN0b3IgaGFzIEsgLSAxIGNvZWZmaWNpZW50cyAoaGVyZSAzKS4="}
In a multinomial model with four outcome categories and Home as the reference, how many coefficients does each predictor have?

- One, which applies to every comparison
- Four, one for each category of the outcome
- Three, one for each comparison with the reference
- Zero, because multinomial models have no coefficients
:::

