The relative risk ratio for wealth is 2.76 for Private hospital versus Home. How should it be read?

- Women in the richest quintile are 2.76 times as likely to be in any hospital
- Odds of private care rather than home rise 2.8-fold per quintile
- The probability of private care is 2.76 for each of the women studied
